    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Say what you see",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Markers opens on <strong>Unknown</strong>. Tap <strong>Equipment</strong> and pick what you see, such as <strong>Car / SUV</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d38e9c9e1cbf6968.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the type",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The type now reads <strong>Car / SUV</strong>. Tap <strong>Place</strong>, then the map.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/785f9d2d7af917a5.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>It is on your map, <strong>NOT SENT</strong> until you send it. Once you know whose it is, tap <strong>Edit</strong> and pick the side.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/636ec123fddd34ea.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Mark civilians",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>For civilians and authorities, open Markers, tap <strong>Neutral</strong>, then the type in the middle. Pick one, such as <strong>Refugees</strong>, and place it the same way.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/743a7d74693dc1e0.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
